                "voice"
              ]
            },
            "description": "Upload an audio/wav file from an iOS, macOS or watchOS Ask DJ PTT client. Backend transcribes via HA STT, routes the transcript through Ask DJ, and returns transcript, text/dj_text, optional images, links, sources and audio_url."
          }
